      "answer": "Not directly. California's AI Transparency Act binds providers whose system has more than 1,000,000 monthly users; below that its disclosure and detection duties do not apply to you, though the platforms and hosts you use take on their own duties from 2027.",
      "context": { "modalities": ["image"], "roles": ["provider"], "markets": ["california"] },
      "expect": []
