      "question": "Does LinkedIn show who made an AI image?",
      "description": "Yes: LinkedIn shows a C2PA icon on images and video with Content Credentials, and the panel names the issuer, whoever signed the manifest.",
      "answer": "It shows who signed it. Images and video with Content Credentials get a C2PA icon on LinkedIn, and the panel behind it shows whether AI was used, the app, the creator, the issuer and the date. The issuer is whoever signed the manifest: your supplier, unless you sign under your own name.",
